<title>FINLAND: Penope rises sharply on 4-month results.</title>
<headline>Penope rises sharply on 4-month results.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish mechanical wood industry machine importer Penope Oy rose sharply on Thursday on improved four-month earnings reported earlier today, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1540/1240 GMT, Penope traded at a year-high 70.00 markka, up 5.00 markka or 7.7 percent in 0.2 million markka volume which is active for the share.</p>
<p>Penope's January-April result before extras and tax rose to a 1.07 million markka profit from a 0.73 million loss in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
